This plugin bundles, unmodified, and is built on:

- F-Droid's index and core libraries, org.fdroid:index-android 0.2.0 and org.fdroid:core-android 0.0.1
  (https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/tree/master/libs), Copyright 2010-2025 F-Droid Limited and
  Contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
- kotlinx.serialization 1.9.0 (https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization), Copyright JetBrains s.r.o.
  and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

src/dev/droidtop/plugins/fdroid/EntryJar.kt and RepoLinks.kt follow the rules of F-Droid's
org.fdroid.index.JarIndexVerifier, org.fdroid.index.v2.EntryVerifier and org.fdroid.repo.RepoUriGetter
(same project and licence), rewritten for a stream and java.net.URI. The list of known repositories is
taken from F-Droid's app/src/main/assets/default_repos.json and org.fdroid.repo.KnownRepos.

